"Reinforced concrete beam design<hr/><small>Simply supported beam of rectangular section to EN 1992-1-1 (recommended values)</small>
'<!--section:materials-->
'<b>Concrete</b> (Table 3.1)
'Strength class'f_ck = ? {30}
'Mean strengths: 'f_cm = f_ck + 8'MPa, 'f_ctm = 0.30*f_ck^(2/3)'MPa
'Modulus of elasticity: 'E_cm = 22*(f_cm/10)^0.3'GPa
'Long-term coefficient (3.1.6): 'α_cc = ? {0.85}' (1.0 recommended; 0.85 conservative)
'Design strength (3.15), with 'γ_c = 1.5': 'f_cd = α_cc*f_ck/γ_c'MPa
'Maximum aggregate size: 'd_g = ? {20}'mm
'<b>Reinforcement</b>
'Yield strength: 'f_yk = ? {500}'MPa
'Design strength, with 'γ_s = 1.15': 'f_yd = f_yk/γ_s'MPa, modulus: 'E_s = 200'GPa
'<b>Durability and fire</b>
'Exposure class'c_min,dur = ? {15}
'Environment'RH = ? {50}
'Fire resistance'R = ? {60}
'<!--section:geometry-->
'Effective span: 'L = ? {6}'m
'Partitions'P_b = ? {0}
'Width: 'b = ? {300}'mm, overall depth: 'h = ? {500}'mm
'Nominal cover to the links: 'c_nom = ? {30}'mm
'Bottom bars: 'n_t = ? {3}' bars, diameter 'Φ_t = ? {20}'mm
'Top bars: 'n_c = ? {2}' bars, diameter 'Φ_c = ? {12}'mm
'Links: 'n_w = ? {2}' legs, diameter 'Φ_w = ? {8}'mm, spacing 's = ? {200}'mm
'Effective depth: 'd = h - c_nom - Φ_w - Φ_t/2'mm, to the top bars: 'd_2 = c_nom + Φ_w + Φ_c/2'mm
'Steel areas: 'A_s1 = n_t*π*Φ_t^2/4'mm², 'A_s2 = n_c*π*Φ_c^2/4'mm²
'<div>
#hide
u_s = min(150/b; 210/h)
u_B = b*u_s
u_H = h*u_s
u_x = 74
u_y = 8
u_c = (c_nom + Φ_w/2)*u_s
u_w = max(Φ_w*u_s; 1)
u_t = max(Φ_t*u_s/2; 2)
u_r = max(Φ_c*u_s/2; 2)
u_yt = u_y + (h - c_nom - Φ_w - Φ_t/2)*u_s
u_yc = u_y + (c_nom + Φ_w + Φ_c/2)*u_s
u_xt = u_x + (c_nom + Φ_w + Φ_t/2)*u_s + if(n_t ≡ 1; (b/2 - c_nom - Φ_w - Φ_t/2)*u_s; 0)
u_dt = (b - 2*(c_nom + Φ_w) - Φ_t)*u_s/max(n_t - 1; 1)
u_xc = u_x + (c_nom + Φ_w + Φ_c/2)*u_s + if(n_c ≡ 1; (b/2 - c_nom - Φ_w - Φ_c/2)*u_s; 0)
u_dc = (b - 2*(c_nom + Φ_w) - Φ_c)*u_s/max(n_c - 1; 1)
u_L = u_x + u_B + 12
u_W = round(u_L + 80)
u_V = round(u_y + u_H + 34)
#show
#val
'<svg alt="section.svg" width="'u_W'" height="'u_V'" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" font-family="Libre Franklin, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#1C1710">
'<rect x="'u_x'" y="'u_y'" width="'u_B'" height="'u_H'" fill="#E8E8E8" stroke="#1C1710" stroke-width="1.5"/>
'<rect x="'u_x + u_c'" y="'u_y + u_c'" width="'u_B - 2*u_c'" height="'u_H - 2*u_c'" rx="'2*u_w'" fill="none" stroke="#2E63C4" stroke-width="'u_w'"/>
#for j = 1 : n_t
'<circle cx="'u_xt + (j - 1)*u_dt'" cy="'u_yt'" r="'u_t'" fill="#1C1710"/>
#loop
#if n_c ≥ 1
#for j = 1 : n_c
'<circle cx="'u_xc + (j - 1)*u_dc'" cy="'u_yc'" r="'u_r'" fill="#1C1710"/>
#loop
#end if
'<line x1="'u_x'" y1="'u_y + u_H + 10'" x2="'u_x + u_B'" y2="'u_y + u_H + 10'" stroke="#1C1710" stroke-width="0.75"/>
'<line x1="'u_x'" y1="'u_y + u_H + 6'" x2="'u_x'" y2="'u_y + u_H + 14'" stroke="#1C1710" stroke-width="0.75"/>
'<line x1="'u_x + u_B'" y1="'u_y + u_H + 6'" x2="'u_x + u_B'" y2="'u_y + u_H + 14'" stroke="#1C1710" stroke-width="0.75"/>
'<text x="'u_x + u_B/2'" y="'u_y + u_H + 27'" text-anchor="middle">'b'</text>
'<line x1="'u_x - 10'" y1="'u_y'" x2="'u_x - 10'" y2="'u_y + u_H'" stroke="#1C1710" stroke-width="0.75"/>
'<line x1="'u_x - 14'" y1="'u_y'" x2="'u_x - 6'" y2="'u_y'" stroke="#1C1710" stroke-width="0.75"/>
'<line x1="'u_x - 14'" y1="'u_y + u_H'" x2="'u_x - 6'" y2="'u_y + u_H'" stroke="#1C1710" stroke-width="0.75"/>
'<text x="'u_x - 16'" y="'u_y + u_H/2 + 4'" text-anchor="end">'h'</text>
'<text x="'u_L'" y="'u_yc + 4'">'n_c' Ø'Φ_c'</text>
'<text x="'u_L'" y="'u_y + u_H/2 + 4'">Ø'Φ_w' @ 's'</text>
'<text x="'u_L'" y="'u_yt + 4'">'n_t' Ø'Φ_t'</text>
'</svg>
#equ
'</div>
'<!--section:loads-->
'Superimposed permanent load: 'g_k,s = ? {10}'kN/m, variable load: 'q_k = ? {8}'kN/m
'Category of use'ψ_2 = ? {0.3}
'Permanent load, with self-weight at 25 kN/m³: 'g_k = g_k,s + 25*b*h*10^-6'kN/m
'Ultimate (6.10): 'w_Ed = 1.35*g_k + 1.5*q_k'kN/m, quasi-permanent (6.16): 'w_qp = g_k + ψ_2*q_k'kN/m
'<!--section:calculations-->
'<h4>Analysis</h4>
'Mid-span moment: 'M_Ed = w_Ed*L^2/8'kNm, quasi-permanent: 'M_qp = w_qp*L^2/8'kNm
'Support shear: 'V_Ed = w_Ed*L/2'kN
'Characteristic reactions: 'R_G = g_k*L/2'kN, 'R_Q = q_k*L/2'kN
#hide
PlotWidth = 680
PlotHeight = 150
#show
'Bending moment (kNm) and shear force (kN):
$Plot{w_Ed*x*(L - x)/2 @ x = 0 : L}
$Plot{w_Ed*(L/2 - x) @ x = 0 : L}
'<h4>Cover (4.4.1)</h4>
'Minimum cover, bond and durability (S4, Table 4.4N): links 'c_min,w = max(Φ_w; c_min,dur; 10)'mm, bars 'c_min,b = max(Φ_t; Φ_c; c_min,dur; 10)'mm
'Required nominal cover, with Δc<sub>dev</sub> = 10 mm (4.1): 'c_nom,req = max(c_min,w; c_min,b - Φ_w) + 10'mm
'Utilisation: 'η_cov = c_nom,req/c_nom
#if η_cov ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Cover provided exceeds cover required</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Cover too small</p>
#end if
'<h4>Fire resistance (EN 1992-1-2, 5.6)</h4>
#hide
i_R = if(R ≤ 30; 1; if(R ≤ 60; 2; if(R ≤ 90; 3; if(R ≤ 120; 4; if(R ≤ 180; 5; 6)))))
#show
#val
'Table 5.5, widths: 'b_1 = take(i_R; 80; 120; 150; 200; 240; 280)', 'b_2 = take(i_R; 120; 160; 200; 240; 300; 350)', 'b_3 = take(i_R; 160; 200; 300; 300; 400; 500)', 'b_4 = take(i_R; 200; 300; 400; 500; 600; 700)'mm
'axis distances: 'a_1 = take(i_R; 25; 40; 55; 65; 80; 90)', 'a_2 = take(i_R; 20; 35; 45; 60; 70; 80)', 'a_3 = take(i_R; 15; 30; 40; 55; 65; 75)', 'a_4 = take(i_R; 15; 25; 35; 50; 60; 70)'mm
'Minimum axis distance for b = 'b' mm, interpolated: 'a_min = if(b ≤ b_2; a_1 + (a_2 - a_1)*(max(b; b_1) - b_1)/(b_2 - b_1); if(b ≤ b_3; a_2 + (a_3 - a_2)*(b - b_2)/(b_3 - b_2); if(b ≤ b_4; a_3 + (a_4 - a_3)*(b - b_3)/(b_4 - b_3); a_4)))'mm
#equ
'Corner bars, one layer (5.6.3(3)): 'a_sd,min = a_min + 10*(b ≤ b_3)'mm
'Axis distance: 'a = c_nom + Φ_w + Φ_t/2'mm
'Utilisation: 'η_fi = max(b_1/b; a_sd,min/a)
#if η_fi ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Width and axis distance meet Table 5.5</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Too narrow, or bars too close to the surface</p>
#end if
'<h4>Bending (6.1)</h4>
'Neutral axis limit without redistribution (5.10a): 'ξ_lim = (1 - 0.44)/1.25
'Moment ratio: 'K = M_Ed*10^6/(b*d^2*f_ck)', limit: 'K′ = α_cc/γ_c*0.8*ξ_lim*(1 - 0.4*ξ_lim)
#if K ≤ K′
	'No compression steel needed (K ≤ K′).
	'Lever arm: 'z = min(d/2*(1 + sqr(1 - 2*K/(α_cc/γ_c))); 0.95*d)'mm, neutral axis: 'x = 2.5*(d - z)'mm
	'Steel required: 'A_s1,req = M_Ed*10^6/(f_yd*z)'mm², 'A_s2,req = 0'mm²
#else
	'Compression steel needed (K > K′).
	'Lever arm: 'z = d/2*(1 + sqr(1 - 2*K′/(α_cc/γ_c)))'mm, neutral axis: 'x = ξ_lim*d'mm
	'Stress in the top bars: 'σ_s2 = min(E_s*10^3*0.0035*(x - d_2)/x; f_yd)'MPa
	'Steel required: 'A_s2,req = (K - K′)*f_ck*b*d^2/(σ_s2*(d - d_2))'mm², 'A_s1,req = K′*f_ck*b*d^2/(f_yd*z) + A_s2,req*σ_s2/f_yd'mm²
#end if
'Utilisation: 'η_M = max(A_s1,req/A_s1; A_s2,req/max(A_s2; 1))
#if η_M ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Steel provided exceeds steel required</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Too little steel: add bars or deepen the section</p>
#end if
'<h4>Steel limits (9.2.1.1) and bar spacing (8.2)</h4>
'Limits: 'A_s,min = max(0.26*f_ctm/f_yk; 0.0013)*b*d'mm², 'A_s,max = 0.04*b*h'mm²
'Utilisation: 'η_lim = max(A_s,min/A_s1; (A_s1 + A_s2)/A_s,max)
#if η_lim ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Steel area within limits</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Steel area outside limits</p>
#end if
'Clear spacing, bottom: 's_b = (b - 2*(c_nom + Φ_w) - n_t*Φ_t)/(n_t - 1)'mm, minimum: 's_b,min = max(Φ_t; d_g + 5; 20)'mm
'Clear spacing, top: 's_c = (b - 2*(c_nom + Φ_w) - n_c*Φ_c)/(n_c - 1)'mm, minimum: 's_c,min = max(Φ_c; d_g + 5; 20)'mm
'Utilisation, layers of two bars or more: 'η_sb = max((n_t ≥ 2)*s_b,min/max(s_b; 1); (n_c ≥ 2)*s_c,min/max(s_c; 1))
#if η_sb ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Bar spacing exceeds the minimum</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Bars too close: fewer, larger bars or two layers</p>
#end if
'<h4>Shear (6.2)</h4>
'Without links (6.2.2): 'k = min(1 + sqr(200/d); 2)', 'ρ_l = min(A_s1/(b*d); 0.02)', 'v_min = 0.035*k^(3/2)*sqr(f_ck)'MPa
'Resistance without links (6.2): 'V_Rd,c = max(0.18/γ_c*k*(100*ρ_l*f_ck)^(1/3); v_min)*b*d*10^-3'kN
'Struts (6.2.3), with 'z_v = 0.9*d'mm and 'ν_1 = 0.6*(1 - f_ck/250)': 'V_Rd,max,45 = b*z_v*ν_1*f_cd/2*10^-3'kN at 45°
'Strut angle, 21.8° to 45°: 'θ = max(21.8; min(0.5*asin(min(V_Ed/V_Rd,max,45; 1)); 45))'°, so 'V_Rd,max = V_Rd,max,45*sin(2*θ)'kN
'Utilisation: 'η_V = V_Ed/V_Rd,max
#if η_V ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Shear force below strut capacity</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Struts crushed: widen or deepen the section, or use stronger concrete</p>
#end if
'Links (6.8, 9.5N): required 'A_sw,req = if(V_Ed > V_Rd,c; V_Ed*10^3/(z_v*f_yd*cot(θ)); 0)'mm²/mm, minimum 'A_sw,min = 0.08*sqr(f_ck)/f_yk*b'mm²/mm
'Provided: 'A_sw = n_w*π*Φ_w^2/4/s'mm²/mm
'Utilisation: 'η_w = max(A_sw,req; A_sw,min)/A_sw
#if η_w ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Links provided exceed links required</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Too few links: closer spacing or larger links</p>
#end if
'Spacing limits (9.6N, 9.8N): 's_l,max = 0.75*d'mm along, 's_t,max = min(0.75*d; 600)'mm across, legs at 's_t = (b - 2*c_nom - Φ_w)/max(n_w - 1; 1)'mm
'Utilisation: 'η_s = max(s/s_l,max; s_t/s_t,max)
#if η_s ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Link spacing within limits</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Links too far apart</p>
#end if
'For curtailment: 'ΔF_td = 0.5*V_Ed*cot(θ)'kN (6.18), shift 'a_l = z_v*cot(θ)/2'mm (9.2.1.3)
'<h4>Creep and shrinkage (Annex B)</h4>
'Notional size: 'h_0 = b*h/(b + h)'mm
'Creep (B.2–B.8), loaded at 28 days: 'φ_RH = (1 + (1 - RH/100)/(0.1*h_0^(1/3))*min((35/f_cm)^0.7; 1))*min((35/f_cm)^0.2; 1)', 'φ = φ_RH*16.8/sqr(f_cm)/(0.1 + 28^0.2)
#val
'k<sub>h</sub> interpolated in Table 3.3: 'k_h = if(h_0 ≤ 100; 1; if(h_0 ≤ 200; 1 - 0.0015*(h_0 - 100); if(h_0 ≤ 300; 0.85 - 0.001*(h_0 - 200); if(h_0 ≤ 500; 0.75 - 0.00025*(h_0 - 300); 0.7))))
#equ
'Shrinkage, cement class N (B.11, 3.8–3.12): 'ε_cd = k_h*0.85*660*exp(-0.012*f_cm)*1.55*(1 - (RH/100)^3)*10^-6', 'ε_cs = ε_cd + 2.5*(f_ck - 10)*10^-6
'Long-term modulus (7.20): 'E_c,eff = E_cm/(1 + φ)'GPa, 'α_e = E_s/E_c,eff
'<h4>Crack control (7.3)</h4>
'Minimum steel (7.1), with k<sub>c</sub> = 0.4 and σ<sub>s</sub> = f<sub>yk</sub>: 'k = min(max(1 - 0.35*(h - 300)/500; 0.65); 1)', 'A_s,min,cr = 0.4*k*f_ctm*b*h/2/f_yk'mm²
'Utilisation: 'η_cm = A_s,min,cr/A_s1
#if η_cm ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Steel exceeds the minimum for crack control</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Too little steel for crack control</p>
#end if
'Cracked section, quasi-permanent load: 'x_cr = (sqr((A_s1 + A_s2)^2 + 2*b*(d*A_s1 + d_2*A_s2)/α_e) - (A_s1 + A_s2))*α_e/b'mm
'Second moment: 'I_cr = b*x_cr^3/3 + α_e*(A_s1*(d - x_cr)^2 + A_s2*(x_cr - d_2)^2)'mm⁴, steel stress: 'σ_s = α_e*M_qp*10^6*(d - x_cr)/I_cr'MPa
'Effective tension area (7.3.2(3)): 'h_c,ef = min(2.5*(h - d); (h - x_cr)/3; h/2)'mm, 'ρ_p,eff = A_s1/(b*h_c,ef)
'Crack spacing (7.11, 7.14), cover 'c = c_nom + Φ_w'mm: 's_r,max = if(s_b + Φ_t ≤ 5*(c + Φ_t/2); 3.4*c + 0.17*Φ_t/ρ_p,eff; 1.3*(h - x_cr))'mm
'Strain (7.9), k<sub>t</sub> = 0.4: 'Δε = max(σ_s - 0.4*f_ctm/ρ_p,eff*(1 + E_s/E_cm*ρ_p,eff); 0.6*σ_s)/(E_s*10^3)
'Crack width (7.8): 'w_k = s_r,max*Δε'mm, limit (Table 7.1N): 'w_max = if(c_min,dur ≤ 15; 0.4; 0.3)'mm
'Utilisation: 'η_cr = w_k/w_max
#if η_cr ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Crack width within limit</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Cracks too wide: more, smaller bars</p>
#end if
'<h4>Deflection (7.4)</h4>
'Steel ratios: 'ρ_0 = sqr(f_ck)*10^-3', 'ρ = A_s1,req/(b*d)', 'ρ′ = A_s2,req/(b*d)
'Basic span/depth, simply supported (7.16a, b): 'l_d,a = 11 + 1.5*sqr(f_ck)*ρ_0/ρ + 3.2*sqr(f_ck)*max(ρ_0/ρ - 1; 0)^1.5', 'l_d,b = 11 + 1.5*sqr(f_ck)*ρ_0/(ρ - ρ′) + sqr(f_ck)*sqr(ρ′/ρ_0)/12', so 'l_d,0 = if(ρ ≤ ρ_0; l_d,a; l_d,b)
'Limit, with 7.17 (at most 1.5) and 7/L for partitions over 7 m: 'l_d,lim = min(500/(f_yk*A_s1,req/A_s1); 1.5)*if(P_b ≡ 1; min(7/L; 1); 1)*l_d,0
'Actual: 'l_d = L*10^3/d', utilisation: 'η_ld = l_d/l_d,lim
#if η_ld ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Span/depth ratio within limit</p>
#else
	'<p>Span/depth ratio exceeds its limit: deflection calculated below (7.4.2(1)).</p>
#end if
'Calculated (7.4.3), quasi-permanent load. Uncracked section: 'A_I = b*h + (α_e - 1)*(A_s1 + A_s2)'mm², 'y_I = (b*h^2/2 + (α_e - 1)*(A_s1*d + A_s2*d_2))/A_I'mm
'Second moment: 'I_I = b*h^3/12 + b*h*(h/2 - y_I)^2 + (α_e - 1)*(A_s1*(d - y_I)^2 + A_s2*(y_I - d_2)^2)'mm⁴, cracking moment: 'M_cr = f_ctm*I_I/(h - y_I)*10^-6'kNm
'Distribution (7.19), sustained load: 'ζ = if(M_qp > M_cr; 1 - 0.5*(M_cr/M_qp)^2; 0)
'Curvatures with shrinkage (7.21): 'κ_I = M_qp*10^6/(E_c,eff*10^3*I_I) + ε_cs*α_e*(A_s1*(d - y_I) - A_s2*(y_I - d_2))/I_I'1/mm
'Cracked: 'κ_II = M_qp*10^6/(E_c,eff*10^3*I_cr) + ε_cs*α_e*(A_s1*(d - x_cr) - A_s2*(x_cr - d_2))/I_cr'1/mm, mean (7.18): 'κ = ζ*κ_II + (1 - ζ)*κ_I'1/mm
'Deflection: 'δ_qp = 5/48*κ*(L*10^3)^2'mm, limit span/250 (7.4.1(4)): 'δ_lim = L*10^3/250'mm
'Utilisation: 'η_δ = δ_qp/δ_lim
#if η_δ ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok">PASS - Deflection within span/250</p>
#else if η_ld ≤ 1
	'<p>Calculated deflection exceeds span/250; the span/depth ratio is within its limit (7.4.2(1)).</p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE">FAIL - Deflection too large: deepen or add steel</p>
#end if
'Deflection utilisation, the better of the two: 'η_def = min(η_ld; η_δ)
'<!--section:results-->
'<div>
#val
'<table class="bordered">
'<tr><th>Check</th><th>Clause</th><th>Utilisation</th><th>Result</th></tr>
'<tr><td>Cover</td><td>4.4.1</td><td>'η_cov'</td><td>
#if η_cov ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Fire resistance</td><td>EN 1992-1-2, 5.6</td><td>'η_fi'</td><td>
#if η_fi ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Bending</td><td>6.1</td><td>'η_M'</td><td>
#if η_M ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Steel limits</td><td>9.2.1.1</td><td>'η_lim'</td><td>
#if η_lim ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Bar spacing</td><td>8.2</td><td>'η_sb'</td><td>
#if η_sb ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Shear: struts</td><td>6.2.3</td><td>'η_V'</td><td>
#if η_V ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Shear: links</td><td>6.2.3, 9.2.2</td><td>'η_w'</td><td>
#if η_w ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Shear: link spacing</td><td>9.2.2</td><td>'η_s'</td><td>
#if η_s ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Cracking: minimum steel</td><td>7.3.2</td><td>'η_cm'</td><td>
#if η_cm ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Crack width</td><td>7.3.4</td><td>'η_cr'</td><td>
#if η_cr ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'<tr><td>Deflection</td><td>7.4.2, 7.4.3</td><td>'η_def'</td><td>
#if η_def ≤ 1
	'<b class="ok">PASS</b>
#else
	'<b style="color:#C00000">FAIL</b>
#end if
'</td></tr>
'</table>
'<p>Governing utilisation: 'η_max = max(η_cov; η_fi; η_M; η_lim; η_sb; η_V; η_w; η_s; η_cm; η_cr; η_def)'</p>
#equ
#if η_max ≤ 1
	'<p class="ok"><b class="ok">The beam passes every check.</b></p>
#else
	'<p style="color:#C00000;background-color:#FFEEEE"><b style="color:#C00000">The beam fails at least one check: see the table above.</b></p>
#end if
'</div>
